description: Keep project workflow and documentation aligned with changes
alwaysApply: true
---

# Workflow discipline

- Update related documentation when architecture, tooling, workflows, or developer expectations change.
- Keep issues, pull requests, and project workflow state aligned with the actual implementation status.
- Prefer small, reviewable changes over large cross-cutting rewrites.
- Avoid introducing temporary behaviour, TODOs, or partial systems without documenting intent and follow-up work.
